      "id": 103974,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-19T01:42:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1. Wraith's damage would not still be increased by Micro Targeting Computer, since she is no longer dealing Projectile.</p><p>If Ra is using Imbued Fire, which changes damage dealt be heroes into fire, while also increasing Fire damage by 1, then the Cyclohexane Vat comes into play. Players may choose to turn it to toxic, then fire, thus getting the +1 for being fire and the +1 from the Cyclohexane Vat, since it isn't reliant on damage type.</p><p>2. If a card refers to the second highest target, and there is only one target in play, then the card would have no effect. So Slash would deal no damage and K.N.Y.F.E. would still be hit by the environment target.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:33:14.516Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
