      "created_at": "2014-05-19T11:54:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>SotM makes me happy, and so do these forums. I don't really care about when things go the way I want or not, just the fact that I'm finding out the correct way to do everything without confusion makes everything so much more fun! And the cool thing about learning that a strategy/combo doesn't work is that you now have the fun of looking for combos that DO work thanks to the clarification on the rules.</p>",
