      "raw": "[quote=\"Ronway\"]\n\nIt&#39;s helps to think of that combo as a combo that was never supposed to work, rather than a combo that no longer works.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI think part of that heartache comes from the fan material that provided insight on how to play Ra that received some notice from the mods/admins.&nbsp; Flamethrower49&#39;s excellent guides have been pinned in the SotM Rules &amp; Gameplay board for quite some time, and a big mention in the Ra guide was this particular combo (in fact, it is still listed in his guide).&nbsp; I understand that the creators can&#39;t read every post in every topic and that the guides aren&#39;t created by them, but they were acknowledged in some minor way by the head honchos of this board.\n\nI definitely think your perspective is a helpful viewpoint for players after confirming how those damage effects were intended to work, but this was an established and popular combo with Ra pinned on the official Rules board for Greater Than Games.&nbsp; It&#39;s somewhat difficult to explain to folks that it wasn&#39;t a part of the game when so many players &quot;misplayed&quot; it that way.\n",
